  <dace:descriptions>
    <dace:description descriptionType="Abstract" xml:lang="en">Static global gravity field model resolved up to degree and order 300, provided together with its time-variable coefficients.

General model description of the static combination model.

Input data are GRACE-FO inter-satellite ranging observations and terrestrial gravity anomalies.

Processing procedures follow a full normal equation combination with variance component estimation.

Specific features of the resulting gravity field are the reduced striping artefacts above degree 120.</dace:description>
  </dace:descriptions>
